### Filter Props

The custom filter component receives props following the `CustomFilterDisplayProps` interface, listed below under [API Reference](#api-reference). If custom props are provided via the `colDef.filterParams` property, these will be additionally added to the props object, overriding items of the same name if a name clash exists.
{% /if %}

